		"Name": "Toro",
		"Details": "With the Trinity Alliance's development of the Heavy and Light Plasma Rifles, the allied governments of the Alliance began distributing them to their military-industrial complexes. The Taurian Concordat ended up with the lion's share of the Heavy Plasma Rifles and put them on a series of refit designs meant to showcase the new weapon's potental. Among those designs was the Toro TR-A-10. The TR-A-10, based on the TR-A-8, dropped the weapons of its progenitor in exchange for a Heavy Plasma Rifle and two LRM-5s. The rifle carries three tons of ammo and the LRMs share a single ton between them. The TR-A-10 proved an adept, if not particularly exceptional, raider and fire support design and would see limited deployment in the TDF.",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_toro"
	},
